要注意这方面的心理弱点，因为环境肯定是越来越差。学佛者都</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%802.assets/640-1671628409288-210.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(一)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</guid><description>气脉是否通畅 中国五千年文化有很多非常了不起的传承，比如说道家、佛家的等等。我们发现，从古至今得到一些成就的人基本上是通过打坐获得的。比如王阳</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%801.assets/640-1671630296005-237.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>[置顶]站桩与静坐详细教程</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</guid><description>姿势与要领 那么站桩和静坐，首先来讲它们的原理其实是一样的，只不过我们把它区分了。 从相上来讲，一个是站着，一个是坐着。现在来讲的话，我们很多人</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/meditation-detailed-guide.assets/9109a2_7a6f160881b244028452d0f0a2b2c727mv2.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>这次才发现，静坐的修复能力那么强...</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0-%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E5%BC%BA/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0-%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E5%BC%BA/</guid><description>昨夜发现颈下淋巴肿大，一颗。 这两天外感，晚上有扎针等治疗。但今早起来静坐之前，觉得淋巴没有变小。静坐的时候，一过性右手腕内侧刺麻感，面部有点</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%99%e6%ac%a1%e6%89%8d%e5%8f%91%e7%8e%b0%20%e9%9d%99%e5%9d%90%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%ae%e5%a4%8d%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9b%e9%82%a3%e4%b9%88%e5%bc%ba.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>我的练功心得：百日筑基 —— 迈出成功的第一步</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%83%E5%8A%9F%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97-%E7%99%BE%E6%97%A5%E7%AD%91%E5%9F%BA-%E8%BF%88%E5%87%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%83%E5%8A%9F%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97-%E7%99%BE%E6%97%A5%E7%AD%91%E5%9F%BA-%E8%BF%88%E5%87%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5/</guid><description>今天无意翻到笔记本第一页开营记录的日期，发现不知不觉中已加入站桩群过百日了。 曾经无数次想要自己好好做一次百日筑基，修复身心，但从没真正成功过</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//i